{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/valia-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1497,"crm_id":"8613","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Valia","slug":"valia-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","display_address":"Dubai Creek Harbour","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":2140000,"display_price":"2.14M","lattitude":25.199449003279,"longitude":55.348414007702,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"1,2,3,4","about":"<p>Valia at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-creek-harbour/\">Dubai Creek Harbour</a> is a residential complex developed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a>, offering 1, 2, 3, and 4-bedroom apartments next to Dubai Square Mall. The project is designed for comfortable daily living, with access to a swimming pool, gym, kids’ play area, and community park.</p><p>Valia by Emaar Properties combines practical apartment layouts, family-friendly amenities, and a prominent position within a growing waterfront community. Buyers can secure a residence with a 10% down payment, while its location beside Dubai Square Mall and Emaar’s established reputation support strong capital appreciation.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feaure_image_3f2db87ea7.jpg","hash":"Feaure_image_3f2db87ea7","name":"Valia at Dubai Creek Harbour Feaure image.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_6799f762ee.jpg","hash":"Banner_6799f762ee","name":"Valia at Dubai Creek Harbour Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate